OL,3,GNEWSAGrieving family's #85k fundraising
OL,4,Ahelps rare disease research
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince Daisy's death, money has been
OL,7,Fraised for research into HLH at
OL,8,FUniversity College London Hospital,
OL,9,Fhelping secure a grant that researchers
OL,10,Fsaid "wouldn't have been possible"
OL,11,Fwithout the fundraising.
OL,13,FHer mum, Rachel Catterall, said Daisy
OL,14,F"lived life to the full" and was "loved
OL,15,Fto bits" by everyone who met her.
